==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[tailor]]'s [[chalk]]|-}}

# A chalk-like material used for marking [[alteration]]s on [[fabric]] in tailoring and [[dressmaking]]. The marks are brushed or washed off the material when no longer needed.

